{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We compute the value of the expression step-by-step following the order of operations (multiplication before addition and subtraction):\n</p><p>First, calculate the two multiplication terms:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d960fa9f13b51dd87713ee1655077ba21ff5609.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[202 \\times 6 = 1212\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/5/ae5a882aa0f4f243ecea40f077a3127f0d298afe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[20 \\times 26 = 520\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Now substitute these back into the original expression:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f2a1aea4e24663f8973c890439b54a4ec6b7c26.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1212 - 520 + 12\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/1/621f039e432bf36bae3462337256dab6200b9923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$520$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/3/17394efcfd48d0f9ce9a15ad4d38d5de1fa8de1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1212$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/2/ec27c0853566968e2278ab5fc92fc0015fbe6010.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1212 - 520 = 692\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Finally, add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a84aba41d2246893742aa39ae2b5b39e83595cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[692 + 12 = 704\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>The correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/f/fdf6c731cafa4640396a25878e1e38ce641e6886.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ 704$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~Icosahedron0288\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_extension\">Solution 1 extension</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 extension\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can also do something different for the calculations. \n</p><p>THe first part, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da675369fa2079594f58fdb384081eb51aea27e7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[202 \\times 6\\]\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, can be written as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/8569e15f716f51841a28e007fcac7c08b6501c7c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[200 \\times 6 + 2 \\times 6\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>We can do something similar for the second part for easier calculations\n</p><p>~xue1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Regional_Problems\" title=\"2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems\">2026 AMC 8 Regional Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171920\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 63/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1853/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37389:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171920 and revision id 292011. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}